  "description": "Hae-Ohm, a former top chef, who is treated like an insane woman for being suspected of killing a man. She was approached by Yundal, a crazy chef that offered to hire her as a chef even without a chef's license for a ridiculous sum of money.  \nEven though she was happy to work as a chef again, she had no idea that the first restaurant guest would be a dead person!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/59572719), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%AF%B8%EC%B9%9C%EB%82%A8%EB%85%80/4096)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/126383), Spanish",
